<http://tool4boxology.org/Component/node_91789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#StatisticalModel> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_151789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskSource> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_151789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RS-02: Jigsaw Training Data Context Bias" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_151789530342903> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Dataset Jigsaw didominasi obrolan media sosial umum sehingga kurang memiliki konteks friendly banter, jargon game, atau sindiran halus in-game." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_161789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Risk> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_161789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R-02: False Positive Toxicity Prediction" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_161789530342903> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Model Task 2 secara keliru memprediksi obrolan netral atau jargon game normal sebagai pesan toksik." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_171789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskControl> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_171789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RC-02: Probability Threshold Calibration" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_171789530342903> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Menetapkan ambang batas probabilitas ketat pada luaran Task 2 sebelum mengaktifkan proses penyensoran pada Task 3." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_181789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Impact> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_181789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I-02: Reduced Chat Engagement" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_181789530342903> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Pemain merasa terganggu dengan sistem moderasi yang tidak akurat sehingga menjadi enggan menggunakan fitur obrolan." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_191789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Consequence> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_191789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-02: Over-Censorship on Sequence Labeling" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_191789530342903> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Kata-kata netral atau tidak toksik pada teks asli pengguna ikut tertutup oleh tanda bintang sensor (***)." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_201789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Impact> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_201789530342903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I-01: Disrupted In-Game Communication" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_201789530342903> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Pemain kesulitan berkoordinasi dan menyampaikan taktik permainan karena pesan terdistorsi atau tersensor secara salah." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Boxology/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Sequential Multi-Task NLP System\n- Lexical Normalization\n- Multi-Label Classification\n- Conditioned Toxic Span Extraction & Raw Text Masking)" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Boxology/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#context> "Obrolan teks in-game real-time (Dota 2 / Multiplayer Online Games).\n\nInput Characteristics: Teks sangat pendek, penuh slang, typo, penyamaran simbol/angka, serta tata bahasa tidak terstruktur.\n\nPreservasi gaya bahasa asli pengguna: kata-kata non-toksik harus tetap mempertahankan bentuk ejaan aslinya (raw text)." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_451789531315116> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskSource> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_451789531315116> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RS-01: MultiLexNorm Lexicon & Domain Bias" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_451789531315116> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Dataset normalisasi tidak sepenuhnya merepresentasikan slang khusus game Dota 2 atau variasi typo acak khas pemain." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537444420> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskSource> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537444420> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RS-03: Token Expansion & Index Shift" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537444420> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Ekspansi 1 kata mentah menjadi frasa banyak kata pada proses normalisasi (contoh: \"wtf\" --> \"what the fuck\") berisiko mengacak urutan indeks kata." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537604208> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Risk> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537604208> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R-01: Hallucination & Over-Normalization in T5" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537604208> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Model T5 mengubah istilah strategi game yang sah (seperti bkb, gank, mid) menjadi kata baku umum atau gagal mempertahankan format delimiter (|)." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537841268> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Risk> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/20bbc63b-7955-4a0c-933d-4648054e1984/node_1789537841268> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R-03: Misaligned Toxic Span Masking" .
